}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\n{1}{G}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Investigate. You gain 2 life.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Cathar\'s Companion gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell from your hand, you may cast target card with the same name as that spell from your graveyard. (You still pay its costs.)', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'Whenever you sacrifice a Clue, you gain 3 life.', 'Woodland Stream enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', 'You gain 5 life.', '[+1]: Creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain trample until end of turn.\n[−1]: Arlinn, Embraced by the Moon deals 3 damage to any target. Transform Arlinn, Embraced by the Moon.\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "Creatures you control have haste and \'{T}: This creature deals damage equal to its power to any target.\'"', '[+1]: Reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. Each opponent loses life equal to its mana value.\n[−X]: Sorin, Grim Nemesis deals X damage to target creature or planeswalker and you gain X life.\n[−9]: Create a number of 1/1 black Vampire Knight creature tokens with lifelink equal to the highest life total among all players.', '[+1]: Scry 1, then draw a card.\n[−2]: Return target creature to its owner\'s hand.\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Whenever an opponent casts their first spell each turn, counter that spell."', '[+1]: Until end of turn, up to one target creature gets +2/+2 and gains vigilance and haste.\n[0]: Create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token. Transform Arlinn Kord.', '[+2]: You may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\n[−2]: Exile target enchantment, tapped artifact, or tapped creature.\n[−8]: Search your library for an artifact or creature card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle. It gains haste. Return it to your hand at the beginning of the next end step.', '{1}, Discard a card: Create a 1/1 black Vampire Knight creature token with lifelink. Activate only once each turn.', '{1}, Discard a card: Transform Elusive Tormentor.', '{1}, {T}: Put a charge counter on Brain in a Jar, then you may cast an instant or sorcery spell with mana value equal to the number of charge counters on Brain in a Jar from your hand without paying its mana cost.\n{3}, {T}, Remove X charge counters from Brain in a Jar: Scry X.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice Vessel of Malignity: Target opponent exiles two cards from their hand. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{1}{G}, Sacrifice Vessel of Nascency: Reveal the top four cards of your library. You may put an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', '{1}{G}: Return target basic land card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice Vessel of Volatility: Add {R}{R}{R}{R}.', '{1}{W}, Exile Dauntless Cathar from your graveyard: Create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{2}: Put target card from your graveyard on the bottom of your library.', '{2}{B}, Discard two cards: Return Ghoulsteed from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{2}{B}: Return Sanitarium Skeleton from your graveyard to your hand.', '{2}{G}: Look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Duskwatch Recruiter.', '{2}{W}, Sacrifice Vessel of Ephemera: Create two 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying.', '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Explosive Apparatus: It deals 2 damage to any target.', "{3}{B}, Exile Ghoulcaller's Accomplice from your graveyard: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{3}{W}: Target Human gains double strike until end of turn.', '{5}{G}: Quilled Wolf gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', '{B}, Pay 1 life, Mill a card, Discard a card, Sacrifice Sinister Concoction: Destroy target creature.', '{B}: Mill a card.\nDelirium — At the beginning of your end step, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, transform Autumnal Gloom.', '{T}, Discard a card: Tap target creature.', '{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Transform Town Gossipmonger.', '{T}: Add {B} or {G}.\nDelirium — Deathcap Cultivator has deathtouch as long as there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Warped Landscape: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{3}: Return Drownyard Temple from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{4}, {T}: Investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{5}, {T}, Pay 1 life: Create a 1/1 white and black Human Cleric creature token.\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice five creatures: Transform Westvale Abbey, then untap it.', '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.', '{U}, Sacrifice Vessel of Paramnesia: Target player mills three cards. Draw a card.']
